# Assisted 1-1 goal/save qualification: air-swim and invincibility fixtures.
# Completion, event, goal and SRAM state are never written.
# Ceiling air-swim from the level start toward the goal
# pole. The goal tape (sprite slot 7 = 0x7B) loads when the camera crosses the
# screen-0x11 boundary at camX = 0x10C0; the swim scrolls the camera there
# organically so the real sprite generator runs. Dumps track progress.
wait 600
press start 2
wait 180
press start 2
wait 900
press b 30
wait 180
press a 30
wait 180
poke 0109 00

# Practice map transfer: map 0, X=0x048, Y=0x198 (1-1 node, translevel $29).
poke 1f11 0000
poke 1f17 4800980148009801
poke 1f1f 0400190004001900
poke 0100 0b
wait 240
press y 2
until 0100 == 14 480
wait 220
press right+y+b 25
press right+y 40
press right+y+b 25
press right+y 40
forcepoke 85 01
forcepoke 1490 30
poke 0f31 090909
